    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McCormack are delighted to present to the market this attractive four-bedroom semi-detached property, ideally situated in the highly sought-after and well-established development of Sandhills on the Hacketstown Road, Carlow.\n\nSandhills is a highly desirable residential development, popular with families, first-time buyers and those looking for a well-connected home within easy reach of Carlow town. The property enjoys an excellent location, offering the benefit of a peaceful residential setting while remaining within close proximity of the town centre and a wide range of local amenities, including schools, shops, sports facilities and recreational areas. The area is also well served by a local bus link, providing added convenience for residents travelling into Carlow town.\n\nPresented to the market in good condition throughout, this spacious home offers well-proportioned and versatile accommodation, making it an ideal choice for modern family living. \n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hallway, bright living room, kitchen/diner, utility room and guest WC. Upstairs, there are four well-appointed bedrooms, with the master bedroom benefiting from its own en-suite. Two of the four bedrooms also feature fitted wardrobes, providing excellent storage, while a family bathroom completes the accommodation.\n\nThe kitchen/diner provides a practical and sociable space for everyday family life and entertaining, while the separate utility room offers additional functionality and storage.\n\nWith its generous accommodation, excellent presentation, desirable location and convenient transport links, this property represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a quality home in one of Carlow's most sought-after residential developments.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate all that this excellent home has to offer.\n\nTo view current offers or place an offer on this property, register for your MyDNG account at mydng.ie.\n\nViewings are strictly by appointment. For further information or to arrange a viewing, contact DNG McCormack Properties on 059 913 3800."
      },
